+**0.3.2** (schema 3, abi 1, no method changes): the Windows port. On Windows every path spklib returns
+is spelled with `/` between components and a drive root as `C:/` (a UNC root as `//server/share/`);
+paths it is given may use either separator. Capture One for Windows' catalogs resolve through
+`ZWINROOT`; a Mac-made catalog read on Windows (no `ZWINROOT`) resolves through `ZMACROOT` and is
+reported offline, as a Windows-made catalog is on a Mac. The helper needs Windows 10 1903 or later
+(its manifest selects the UTF-8 code page).
 
 One surface, two transports:
 
